---
import Layout from "@/layouts/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout title="About" description="Floof is a Southwest Florida clothing brand — witty tees and hoodies, printed fresh when you order.">
  <section class="border-b border-floof-dark/6 bg-floof-sand/50">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-14 md:py-20">
      <p class="eyebrow">Our story</p>
      <h1 class="mt-3 font-display text-4xl md:text-5xl font-semibold text-floof-dark">
        About <span class="text-floof-pink">Floof</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-floof-dark/55">Gulf Coast ease, with a sense of humor.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-16 space-y-12">
    <div>
      <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-floof-dark">The short version</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-floof-dark/65 leading-relaxed">
        Southwest Florida has a character you can&rsquo;t buy in generic palm-tree merch. We make small drops of soft, well-cut blanks with lines that land — printed to order so nothing sits in a warehouse waiting to go stale.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-floof-dark">What&rsquo;s with the name?</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-floof-dark/65 leading-relaxed">
        Floof is the sound a beach umbrella makes when the wind catches it. Light, a little ridiculous, and completely at home here. Unserious by design — without being careless about the product.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="pt-4">
      <a href="/store" class="btn btn--lg">Shop the collection</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
